{"id": "6fcc1313-503c-456b-950a-405b0df102a6", "slug": "digital-excellence-platform", "title": "Digital Excellence Platform", "description": "Digital Excellence Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Digital Excellence Platform\"\ndescription: \"Digital Excellence Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#EF233C\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#3B82F6\"\n  background: \"#000000\"\n  surface: \"#1A1A1A\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Digital Excellence Platform\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 221; favorites: 4; remixes: 1.\nTags: dashboard, animated, cta, bento, charts, billing, navigation, links.\n## Overview\nDigital Excellence Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\nNexus Methodology Case Studies Capabilities Initiate Connect Featured Case Study Digital Excellence A comprehensive look into our methodology for building scalable platforms that drive unprecedented user engagement and…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Digital Excellence; System Telemetry; Synapse AI; Vortex Exchange; Analytics; Growth Rate.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #EF233C, secondary #000000, accent #3B82F6, background #000000, surface #1A1A1A, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"dark\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Digital Excellence Platform</title>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#000000] text-white antialiased selection:bg-[#ef233c] selection:text-white min-h-screen relative overflow-x-hidden\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n  <!-- Background Glows -->\n  <div class=\"fixed top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] h-[500px] pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(239,35,60,0.05) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%);\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Header Navigation -->\n  <nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 w-full z-50 bg-[#000000]/80 backdrop-blur-xl border-b border-white/5 h-20 px-6 flex items-center justify-between transition-all duration-300\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 group cursor-pointer\">\n      <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-[#ef233c] rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform\">\n        <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"text-white font-light tracking-widest uppercase text-xs\">Nexus</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-xs font-light tracking-widest uppercase text-zinc-500\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Methodology</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Case Studies</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Capabilities</a>\n    </div>\n\n    <button class=\"hidden sm:flex text-xs font-light uppercase tracking-widest text-white border border-white/10 px-5 py-2.5 hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-colors duration-300 items-center gap-2\">\n      Initiate Connect\n      <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-sm\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n    </button>\n\n    <button class=\"flex sm:hidden text-white\">\n      <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" class=\"text-2xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n    </button>\n  </nav>\n\n  <section class=\"hero-trigger relative z-20 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto mt-32 mb-24 pt-10 px-6 pb-32 flex flex-col gap-16\">\n\n    <!-- Section Header (Centered Layout Remixed) -->\n    <div class=\"relative w-full flex flex-col items-center text-center justify-center\">\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col max-w-4xl gap-8 items-center\">\n        <!-- Eyebrow -->\n        <div class=\"reveal-text-js flex items-center gap-3 uppercase text-xs font-light text-[#ef233c] tracking-widest\">\n          Featured Case Study\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Text container -->\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 items-center\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl font-light text-white tracking-tighter flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-3 gap-y-2\">\n            <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-2 -mb-2\">\n              <span class=\"inline-block translate-y-[110%] reveal-word\">Digital</span>\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-2 -mb-2\">\n              <span class=\"inline-block translate-y-[110%] reveal-word text-transparent bg-clip-text\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to right, #ef233c, #ff4d6d);\">\n                Excellence\n              </span>\n            </span>\n          </h2>\n\n          <p class=\"reveal-text-js leading-relaxed text-lg md:text-xl font-light text-gray-400 max-w-2xl\">\n            A comprehensive look into our methodology for building scalable platforms that drive unprecedented user engagement and market dominance.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Call to action button -->\n        <button class=\"group mt-4 flex min-w-[180px] transition-transform active:scale-95 cursor-pointer outline-none w-auto h-14 pr-8 pl-8 relative items-center justify-center border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden rounded-sm\" type=\"button\">\n          <!-- Glow Hover Layer -->\n          <div class=\"pointer-events-none transition-opacity ease-in-out duration-700 group-hover:opacity-100 opacity-0 absolute inset-0\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(60% 50% at 50% 100%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 100%);\"></div>\n\n          <!-- Content Layer -->\n          <div class=\"relative z-20 flex items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n            <span class=\"m-0 p-0 text-sm font-light text-white tracking-widest uppercase\">\n              View Deployment\n            </span>\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n          </div>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Bottom separator line -->\n      <div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-0 right-0 -bottom-10 h-px\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.15), transparent);\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Bento Grid (Layout Swapped & Reorganized) -->\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-4\">\n\n      <!-- Left: profile, stats & thumbnails (Moved to Left Col) -->\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col h-full gap-6\">\n\n        <!-- Desktop App Interface Remix -->\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col border border-white/10 bg-[#0a0a0a] rounded-xl shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden group backdrop-blur-md\">\n\n          <!-- App Header Bar -->\n          <div class=\"h-10 bg-[#111111] border-b border-white/5 flex items-center px-4 justify-between w-full select-none\">\n            <!-- macOS Window Controls -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 w-1/3\">\n              <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/10 group-hover:bg-[#ff5f56] transition-colors duration-300\"></div>\n              <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/10 group-hover:bg-[#ffbd2e] transition-colors duration-300\"></div>\n              <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/10 group-hover:bg-[#27c93f] transition-colors duration-300\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- App Title -->\n            <div class=\"w-1/3 flex justify-center items-center gap-2 text-zinc-500\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:monitor-linear\" class=\"text-sm\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n              <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-zinc-400 uppercase tracking-widest truncate hidden sm:block\">Nexus Monitor</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- App Actions -->\n            <div class=\"w-1/3 flex justify-end gap-2 text-zinc-500\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:minus-linear\" class=\"text-sm cursor-pointer hover:text-white transition-colors\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:stop-linear\" class=\"text-sm cursor-pointer hover:text-white transition-colors\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- App Content Area -->\n          <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row p-6 gap-6 justify-between items-start sm:items-center relative bg-[#0a0a0a]\">\n\n            <!-- Subtle top glow for dashboard panel effect -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/10 to-transparent opacity-30\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Left: Dashboard Breadcrumb/Status -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 relative z-10 w-full sm:w-auto\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-500 text-xs font-light\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-sm\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span>/</span>\n                <span class=\"hover:text-white cursor-pointer transition-colors\">Infrastructure</span>\n                <span>/</span>\n                <span class=\"text-zinc-300 font-medium\">Core Cluster</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1\">\n                <span class=\"relative flex h-2 w-2\">\n                  <span class=\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75\"></span>\n                  <span class=\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-emerald-500\"></span>\n                </span>\n                <h1 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-light tracking-tight text-white\">\n                  System Telemetry\n                </h1>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right: Live Dashboard Metrics -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap sm:flex-nowrap gap-6 sm:gap-8 text-xs relative z-10 w-full sm:w-auto sm:justify-end\">\n\n              <!-- Metric 1: CPU Load -->\n              <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5 w-full sm:w-auto flex-1 sm:min-w-[120px]\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-zinc-500 w-full gap-4\">\n                  <span class=\"uppercase tracking-widest font-light text-xs\">CPU Load</span>\n                  <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-2\">\n                  <span class=\"text-xl font-light text-white tracking-tight\">34%</span>\n                  <span class=\"text-emerald-400 text-xs flex items-center gap-0.5\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-down-linear\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    2.4%\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"w-full h-0.5 bg-white/5 rounded-full overflow-hidden mt-1\">\n                  <div class=\"h-full bg-white/40 rounded-full w-[34%]\"></div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- Metric 2: Memory Usage -->\n              <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5 w-full sm:w-auto flex-1 sm:min-w-[120px]\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-zinc-500 w-full gap-4\">\n                  <span class=\"uppercase tracking-widest font-light text-xs\">Memory</span>\n                  <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:database-linear\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-2\">\n                  <span class=\"text-xl font-light text-white tracking-tight\">64<span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 ml-0.5 font-normal tracking-normal\">GB</span></span>\n                  <span class=\"text-zinc-500 text-xs\">/ 128GB</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"w-full h-0.5 bg-white/5 rounded-full overflow-hidden mt-1\">\n                  <div class=\"h-full bg-[#ef233c] rounded-full w-[50%]\"></div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bio & socials grid -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-6\">\n          <div class=\"md:col-span-3 flex flex-col gap-6 bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/10 p-6 backdrop-blur-md justify-between\">\n            <p class=\"leading-relaxed text-sm text-zinc-400 font-light\">\n              We engineer digital platforms that fuse aesthetics, systems, and foresight. Our methodology relies on precise design frameworks and scalable architecture to ensure brands dominate the contemporary landscape.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 mt-2\">\n              <button class=\"inline-flex hover:bg-[#ef233c] hover:border-[#ef233c] hover:text-white transition duration-300 text-xs font-light uppercase tracking-widest text-white bg-white/5 border border-white/10 py-2 px-4 gap-2 items-center\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-linear\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                Showreel\n              </button>\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-zinc-500 font-light uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#ef233c] animate-pulse rounded-full\"></span>\n                Available for Q4\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"md:col-span-2 flex flex-col gap-3 bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/10 p-4 backdrop-blur-md\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-xs text-white\">\n              <button class=\"flex items-center justify-between bg-black/40 border border-white/5 px-4 py-3 hover:bg-[#ef233c] hover:border-[#ef233c] transition group\">\n                <span class=\"font-light\">LinkedIn</span>\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-zinc-500 group-hover:text-white text-sm\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"flex items-center justify-between bg-black/40 border border-white/5 px-4 py-3 hover:bg-[#ef233c] hover:border-[#ef233c] transition group\">\n                <span class=\"font-light\">Behance</span>\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-zinc-500 group-hover:text-white text-sm\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"mt-auto w-full inline-flex hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-colors duration-300 text-xs font-light uppercase tracking-widest text-white bg-[#ef233c] py-3 px-4 items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n              <span>Engage</span>\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-sm\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Latest work thumbnails -->\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col flex-1 bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/10 p-5 backdrop-blur-md gap-4 min-h-[280px]\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/5 pb-3 mb-1\">\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-light uppercase tracking-widest text-[#ef233c]\">\n              Recent Deployments\n            </span>\n            <button class=\"text-xs font-light uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-500 hover:text-white transition-colors\">\n              Archive\n            </button>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 flex-1\">\n            <!-- Card 1 -->\n            <article class=\"group relative bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-white/5 overflow-hidden flex flex-col h-full min-h-[200px] cursor-pointer\">\n              <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1629946832022-c327f74956e0?w=800&q=80\" alt=\"Dark abstract gradient\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-105 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-30\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              <div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.9), transparent);\"></div>\n\n              <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 p-3 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 z-10\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#ef233c] w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center text-white\">\n                  <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-base\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"mt-auto relative p-5 z-10\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-white font-light tracking-tight text-base mb-1 translate-y-2 group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-300\">\n                  Synapse AI\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-light opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-300 delay-75\">\n                  Core System\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n\n            <!-- Card 2 -->\n            <article class=\"group relative bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-white/5 overflow-hidden flex flex-col h-full min-h-[200px] cursor-pointer\">\n              <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1724525647065-f948fc102e68?w=800&q=80\" alt=\"Abstract architectural forms\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-105 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-30\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              <div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.9), transparent);\"></div>\n\n              <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 p-3 opacity-0 group-hover: